responseFromOwnerText:
Dear Valued Guest,
We are truly pleased to receive your positive review.&nbsp;

Thank you for letting us know how much you enjoyed it;

&nbsp;we are especially pleased that you felt well-looked after.&nbsp;

We will definitely pass on your heartened review to our team members.&nbsp;

We look forward to having you with us again in the near future.

Regards,
Conrad Management Team&nbsp;
